text = "15 lost things are buried under the leaves somewhere in this forest.
Look for warm light shining up through the leaves, then drag the rake to dig them out.
Every one of them does something: check its tooltip in the inventory (E).
Squirrels bury acorns all over. Rake where little sprouts poke through the leaves,
and throw one to blow the leaves off a stubborn spot."
horizontal_alignment = 1

